WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Michael: You shouldn't have come here.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Sarah: I had to. I got your message.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Michael: That wasn't from me.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Michael: I've never been to that building before.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Sarah: But you recognized the photograph.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Michael: I don't know what you're talking about.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Sarah: The key is missing.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Michael: Who else knew about it?

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Michael: I'm going down there.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Sarah: Wait. I'm coming with you.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:04.000
Michael: Stay behind me.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:10.000
Sarah: What are you looking for?

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.000
Michael: The cabinet. Open it.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:10.000
Sarah: It's empty.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:16.000
Michael: No. Look behind it.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.000
Sarah: A photograph...

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:10.000
Sarah: This is the same building.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:16.000
Sarah: My father used to work there.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.000
Michael: We need to leave. Now.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:10.000
Sarah: Not until you tell me the truth.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.000
Michael: I knew your father.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:10.000
Michael: That's why I asked you to come.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:04.000
Sarah: The signal. It's still active.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:10.000
Michael: Then we're not alone here.
